{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195933-scion-hero-exp-cost-of-boons","id":1195933,"title":"Scion hero exp cost of boons","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-15T20:00:22-07:00","id":1195933,"title":"Scion hero exp cost of boons","content":"Hey guys!<br /> <br /> Anyone knows the cost and rules to acquire new boons? I couldt find on book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5311-thiagocord","name":"Thiagocord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-15T20:44:30-07:00","id":1195942,"title":"","content":"There isn't one because Boons cannot be purchased. You start with 2, and get one more per increase in Legend.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/258-thesarcasticsage","name":"TheSarcasticSage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar258_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T04:53:45-07:00","id":1196011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheSarcasticSage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195933-scion-hero-exp-cost-of-boons?p=1195942#post1195942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There isn't one because Boons cannot be purchased. You start with 2, and get one more per increase in Legend.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow i forgot that part, i will read again the traits part.<br /> <br /> Thanks a lot man.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5311-thiagocord","name":"Thiagocord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T07:34:44-07:00","id":1196046,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheSarcasticSage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195933-scion-hero-exp-cost-of-boons?p=1195942#post1195942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There isn't one because Boons cannot be purchased. You start with 2, and get one more per increase in Legend.</div> </div> </div> </div>I assume that's going to somehow change as one advances to Demigod and on to Godhood? I can't imagine the rules saying that Gods only have about 12 Boons in total.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">&quot;We have done the impossible, and that makes us mighty.&quot;<br /> Captain Malcolm Reynolds</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/679-unnatural1","name":"unnatural1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T08:30:15-07:00","id":1196070,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>unnatural1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195933-scion-hero-exp-cost-of-boons?p=1196046#post1196046\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I assume that's going to somehow change as one advances to Demigod and on to Godhood? I can't imagine the rules saying that Gods only have about 12 Boons in total.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope so too... given that Shiva <i>has</i> 12 Purviews (and let's be honest that was <i>after</i> cutting them down) I can't imagine he's only got one Boon a piece, out of all the Hero Demigod and God level ones.<br /> <br /> EDIT : Scratch that, he's also got Yoga, so 13 Purviews.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1344,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1344-samudra","user":"Samudra","date":". 03-16-2018, 11:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1344-samudra","name":"Samudra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1344_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"497"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T11:24:25-07:00","id":1196139,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samudra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195933-scion-hero-exp-cost-of-boons?p=1196070#post1196070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I hope so too... given that Shiva <i>has</i> 12 Purviews (and let's be honest that was <i>after</i> cutting them down) I can't imagine he's only got one Boon a piece, out of all the Hero Demigod and God level ones.<br /> <br /> EDIT : Scratch that, he's also got Yoga, so 13 Purviews.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I mean, he could; I believe Neall said Sun Wukong (who has 10 Purviews) also only has like one Boon apiece. But unless I am mistaken, you can emulate Boons with a Marvel, so maybe that's how he gets around it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1897-ffanxii4ever","name":"ffanxii4ever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"109"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T11:37:00-07:00","id":1196147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ffanxii4ever</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195933-scion-hero-exp-cost-of-boons?p=1196139#post1196139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I mean, he could; I believe Neall said Sun Wukong (who has 10 Purviews) also only has like one Boon apiece. But unless I am mistaken, you can emulate Boons with a Marvel, so maybe that's how he gets around it?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think what he specifically said was : <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Some Gods have more Purviews than others; this is a function of both total Boon investment into Purviews and Legend. Some Gods have the bare minimum for a Purview to be &quot;associated&quot; with them; others have every single Boon in the Purview, and then some. I think, currently, Sun Wukong has a truly ridiculous number of Purviews associated with him, but in the current playtest build this means he doesn't have investment beyond the Demigod level in anything but the Epics, and those just barely.&quot;<br /> <br /> Which kind of still implies that he still has more than one boon in the non Epics, but I could be misreading that... then again this is all regarding an earlier build so nothing about this might be true anymore <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Shiva, unlike Sun Wukong, usually <i>feels</i> like a deity that has more than minimal investment in a lot things... then again this is more a problem with Shiva, who is a headache and a half to try and stat up in any system... you could give him Wild Water Health and Beasts (Snakes) in addition to what he has right now and it wouldn't be that much of a stretch. Add to that that he's a top notch Yogi and should ideally have many Yoga Boons... So really this might just be a Shiva problem.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1344-samudra","name":"Samudra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1344_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"497"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T13:27:30-07:00","id":1196200,"title":"","content":"In general, the Boons have different enough niches that I don't feel compelled to get them all even if I want to play the God of X. A God of Prophecy might want Divination from Fortune, Cosmic Perspective from Stars, and Divine Right from Order, but none of the other Boons associated with those Purviews. It helps take a lot of the pressure off and makes me feel a lot less apprehensive about the small number of Boons Heroes have.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T14:30:15-07:00","id":1196227,"title":"","content":"We might also consider the possibility that, like in 1e, Demigod and God might come with &quot;upgrade&quot; templates, and those might have boon slots attached.<br /> <br /> (Feel free to correct me if it's been confirmed elsewhere that no such upgrade templates will accompany those books.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12628-yukikaze","name":"yukikaze","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12628_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-16T14:35:34-07:00","id":1196228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>yukikaze</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1195933-scion-hero-exp-cost-of-boons?p=1196227#post1196227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We might also consider the possibility that, like in 1e, Demigod and God might come with &quot;upgrade&quot; templates, and those might have boon slots attached.<br /> <br /> (Feel free to correct me if it's been confirmed elsewhere that no such upgrade templates will accompany those books.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Neither confirmed nor denied. Demigod and God are still very much works in progress.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T09:15:01-07:00","id":1196508,"title":"","content":"I could go with a god only having 12 at a time, or even 6 and havving to meditate for a bit letting some float away to bring other's to the fore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}